1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:03,660
(Sheldon:)And finally,
its main ingredient is paneer...

2
00:00:03,826 --> 00:00:06,916
...a farmer's cheese that would cause
Leonard to render any room...

3
00:00:07,079 --> 00:00:09,919
(Sheldon:)...uninhabitable within minutes.

4
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,710
(Penny:)Yum.

5
00:00:14,795 --> 00:00:17,585
(Penny:)- Well, enjoy your big evening.
- Penny?

6
00:00:18,257 --> 00:00:20,427
I realize you're also on your own tonight.

7
00:00:20,593 --> 00:00:23,383
(Sheldon:)So if at some point
you find yourself with nothing to do...

8
00:00:23,554 --> 00:00:25,594
(Sheldon:)...please do not disturb me.

9
00:00:26,932 --> 00:00:30,182
- Have fun, Sheldon.
- Oh, I shall.

10
00:00:30,353 --> 00:00:32,353
[HUMMING "SUPERMAN" THEME SONG]

11
00:00:40,946 --> 00:00:43,946
(Sheldon:)No!

12
00:00:45,242 --> 00:00:48,792
(Penny:)What's wrong, Superman?
Locked out of your big ice thingy?

13
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:58,630
(Raj:)Look at this.

